# Every text file is stored and checked out with LF, whatever core.autocrlf says.
# The toolkit runs in a Linux container built from this working tree, where a
# CRLF Makefile or script breaks, and generated files (vendor fixtures, dbt
# models) are compared byte for byte.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary outputs that may land next to the sources.
*.png binary
*.duckdb binary
*.parquet binary
*.sqlite binary
